From add6385d2f531b693d134b85a9341469b5bee057 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vibe <vibe@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:18:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Port foliar prospect generation to the phsdata storage
 (prepareProspect/createDatabasesReadingProperties)

- Move ProspectExternParameters/ProspectExternalModule/FluorescenceExternParameters
  to shared opticalMaterials/ProspectExternalModule.hpp
- New phsdata::UnderstoryModel (modelName, databaseName, prospectExternalModule);
  phsdata::UnderstoryMulti extended with top/bottom model nodes + getters
- prepareProspect(): foliar loop over genDTO._volumesMaterials, uuid database
  stored in the model's databaseName (trigger mirrors Lambertian)
- createDatabasesReadingProperties(genDTO): foliar entries built from the struct,
  static mapPrepareProspectFoliarTop/Bottom and dead PhaseDAO readers removed,
  foliar specular data dropped (external XML upgrader handles old inputs)
- processVegetationVolumeMaterials: foliar model count from genDTO._volumesMaterials
---
